  "debtToEquityTTM": null,
  "description": "Klaviyo, Inc. is a technology company offering a software-as-a-service (SaaS) platform that empowers its clients to send highly targeted and pertinent messages via email, text message (SMS), and push notifications. The firm's primary product, Klaviyo, is a marketing automation platform engineered for personalized outreach. Its comprehensive suite of solutions includes an email marketing tool that meticulously monitors clicks and purchases to enhance campaign effectiveness; an SMS service crafted for fostering e-commerce expansion and customer loyalty; and a mobile push feature for direct engagement with users through lock screen alerts. Additionally, Klaviyo provides a Review solution to collect product feedback and a robust customer data platform (CDP) designed for efficient storage, analysis, and utilization of large datasets. The company caters to individual users, small and medium-sized businesses, and larger corporations across North America, Western Europe, Canada, the United Kingdom, Australia, and New Zealand. Established in 2012, Klaviyo is headquartered in Boston, Massachusetts.",
